  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Economic Resilience in Seasonal Migrant Families</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will increase economic participation of women from seasonal migrant families while engaging men/boys in reducing Violence Against Women and Girls (VAWG). The project will build knowledge of 250 women in financial literacy, establish 10 women led business and build vocational capacity of 21 women.</narrative>
  </description>
